From e3f490bca5767c06454f493a4bd6ff2ce3353e28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maalh <sometimes7799s@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 15:00:36 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 13/18] feat(web): live toasts that disclose only what each
 screen may know

A landlord or bank window hears only that an application reached it, an
employer a bare 'Journey updated', a phone its own person, the hub nothing.
Drafts, approvals, consents and agent notes never cross screens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
